<title>AUSTRIA: Austria Natbank calls for repo bids at unch 3 pct.</title>
<headline>Austria Natbank calls for repo bids at unch 3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank on Thursday called for bids on two-week securities repurchase agreements at a fixed rate of three percent, unchanged from last week.</p>
<p>Last week, the central bank allotted 7.54 billion schillings, filling seven percent of bids.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12257</p>
</text>
